# MindVault — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and fill in your values.
Never commit `.env` or any real credentials to git.

# ── AI Assistant (optional — app works fully offline without these) ──────────

# Google Gemini Flash API key
# Get yours free at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Groq inference API key (Llama / Mixtral, free tier available)
# Get yours free at: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

# ── Database ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Absolute path to the SQLite database file
# Default: data/mindvault.db (relative to working directory)
MINDVAULT_DB=data/mindvault.db

# ── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Port for the FastAPI backend (Tauri spawns this automatically)
MINDVAULT_PORT=8765

# ── Storage ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Directory where ingested documents are stored
MINDVAULT_STORAGE_DIR=storage/documents
